  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38989b43b1e684fbbb8e79ec001b0324, type: 3}
  m_Name: SharkTankPitch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  isAutomatic: 1
  speakers: 000000000000000003000000000000000000000002000000040000000000000004000000030000000300000000000000
  dialogue:
  - "Hi Sharks, I\u2019m Finnley, creator of LinkedFin! I\u2019m seeking 100,000
    sand dollars for a 10% equity stake in my company."
  - LinkedFin is a professional networking app that allows businesses and recruiters
    to easily connect with talent.
  - Why do we need an app when we can network at ReefCon?
  - "Well, it\u2019s much easier to get your resume to multiple companies on your
    phone than to wait in line at every booth here."
  - And on LinkedFin you can keep your profile up to date with your latest resume
    and headshot.
  - "Juveniles and pups can friend each other and trade pictures on social networks.
    You want grownup professionals to friend each other over the web? That\u2019ll
    never work. I\u2019m out."
  - "What\u2019s your current user base?"
  - "Right now it\u2019s just me and some of my fellow business school alum."
  - "I\u2019ll need to see some traction before I could even think to invest. Talk
    to me when you have more users. I\u2019m out."
  - "Sorry Finnley, I just don\u2019t see how your app could ever replace ReefCon.
    If you could prove it's a better way to connect, I might reconsider."
  - 'Thanks for coming in today. '
  - Thank you, sharks.
